sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Web
    participant S as Server
    participant D as DB
    W->>S: request
    par Query one
        S->>D: SELECT a
    and Query two
        S->>D: SELECT b
    end
    critical Establish connection
        S-->>W: ok
    option Timeout
        S--xW: fail
    end
    rect rgb(200,200,255)
        W->>S: again
    end
    loop Health check
        S->>S: ping
    end
    Note right of D: cached
    Note left of W: browser
